Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:49:49 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 39/54] Guide: Sign In from the Guide (signin.xex, 1 pane)

XamShowSigninUIp(user, 1, 0x10000) from the signed-out Guide menu (Sign In
or X): signin1.xur's UserList with the console's profiles (gamertag, "Xbox
Live" if Live-enabled, the device, the gamer picture from the profile's
tile_64.png), A -> status.xur "Signing in" -> signed in on the Guide's
controller; B / Guide close it. No profiles: the "No Profiles Found" box
(Create New Profile / Exit). ProfileManager::GetProfilePath is public.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
